<title>BELGIUM: Belgian tax receipts up 4.8 pct in 4 mths to April.</title>
<headline>Belgian tax receipts up 4.8 pct in 4 mths to April.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total Belgian fiscal receipts were up 4.8 percent in April 1997 from April 1996 and up 4.8 percent in the first four months of 1997 from the same 1996 period, the Finance Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>TAX RECEIPTS (in million bfr)</p>
<p>				     April 97    April 96     pct change</p>
<p>    Total			  306,744	292,827	4.8</p>
<p>    Direct taxation	    182,355	194,319     -6.2</p>
<p>    V.A.T and similar taxes   69,028	 67,516	2.2</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE TAX RECEIPTS (in million bfr)</p>
<p>				     Jan-Apr 97   Jan-Apr 96  pct change</p>
<p>    Total			    800,537	763,771    4.8</p>
<p>    Direct taxation		467,031	457,983    2.0</p>
<p>    V.A.T and similar taxes    193,010	188,976    2.1</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
